<h1 class="nm-h1" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;line-height:34px;font-weight:600;color:#1B2B4B;">
  Reset your password
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  We received a request to reset the password for {{maskedEmail}}. Choose a new one below.
</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="nm-cta" style="margin:24px 0;">
  <tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#1B2B4B" style="border-radius:8px;">
    <a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 32px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Choose a new password</a>
  </td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;color:#4B5563;font-size:14px;">
  This link expires in {{expiryMinutes}} {{plural expiryMinutes "minute" "minutes"}} and can be used once.
</p>
<p style="margin:0;padding:14px 16px;background-color:#F5F3EE;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#6B7280;">
  <strong style="color:#1A1C20;">Didn't request this?</strong> Your password has not changed.
  Ignore this email and the link expires on its own. If this keeps happening, contact
  <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color:#1B2B4B;">{{supportEmail}}</a>.
</p>
